{"id":"s-113","nama":"Satrio Yudho Pratomo","bio":"Satrio Yudho Pratomo adalah seniman dari Bandung yang terpilih di Open Call ARTSUBS 2025—Material Ways. Gaya artistiknya berupa pixel art atau gambar digital yang diedit menjadi gambar piksel. Hasil dari karya tersebut berupa video digital dua dimensi dalam format gerak atau GIF. \n\nKarya seninya yang khas membuat Satrio berpartisipasi dalam berbagai pameran grup di berbagai negara, seperti Indonesia, Amerika Serikat, Perancis, Portugal, Italia, Singapura, Kanada, dan Korea Selatan.","domisili":"Bandung","negara":"Indonesia","karya":[{"id":"k-0079","seniman_id":"s-012","judul":"Time To Remember","gambar":["https://s3.artsubs.co/images/karya/k-0079.jpg?v=eb05a0"],"tahun":"2024-2026","medium":"Perunggu","kolaborasi":true,"seniman_ids":["s-012","s-113"],"type":"kolaborasi","seniman_label":"Arkiv Vilmansa x Satrio Yudho Pratomo × Satrio Yudho Pratomo","slug":"time-to-remember"},{"id":"k-0083","seniman_id":"s-113","judul":"What Time Keeps #1-10","tahun":2026,"medium":"Digitally hand-drawn drawing: \nGIF,  ESP32 display, metal frame","ukuran":"Dimensi Bervariasi","seniman_ids":["s-113"],"type":"individu","seniman_label":"Satrio Yudho Pratomo","slug":"what-time-keeps-1-10"},{"id":"k-0084","seniman_id":"s-113","judul":"A Machine Dream\nA Ghost Remembers","tahun":2026,"medium":"Uv print on stainless steel, 6666 generated words on e-paper on raspberry pi & esp32, aluminum profile frame.","ukuran":"Dimensi Bervariasi","seniman_ids":["s-113"],"type":"individu","seniman_label":"Satrio Yudho Pratomo","slug":"a-machine-dream-a-ghost-remembers"},{"id":"k-0686","seniman_id":"s-113","judul":"What Time Keeps #1","gambar":["https://s3.artsubs.co/images/karya/k-0686.jpg?v=7a8e8e"],"tahun":2026,"ukuran":"14 x 17,5 cm","seniman_ids":["s-113"],"type":"individu","seniman_label":"Satrio Yudho Pratomo","slug":"what-time-keeps-1"},{"id":"k-0687","seniman_id":"s-113","judul":"What Time Keeps #2","gambar":["https://s3.artsubs.co/images/karya/k-